icitly deletes `OPENAI_API_KEY` to prove no real credentials are needed. Then runs `analyzeBundlePipeline(bundlePath)` (WITHOUT `noAi: true`). This exercises the full wired path: `loadAIConfig` (replay-enabled) → `LLMClient` (constructed with placeholder key) → `ReplayableLLMClient` wrapper → `CassetteRecorder.replay()`.\\n\\n3. Verify: (a) `result.aiMode` is `'cloud'` (the default provider when replay-enabled), (b) findings include at least one AI-sourced finding (id starts with `finding:ai:`), (c) replayed AI findings pass `validateAIFindings` schema checks, (d) the combined heuristic + replayed-AI findings still pass the golden expectations for each scenario, (e) no network calls were made (the inner `LLMClient.investigateSeed` was never invoked — verified via the ReplayableLLMClient's zero-delegation guarantee from step 5).\\n\\n4. Test graceful degradation: for a scenario with NO matching cassettes (e.g. wrong-db-endpoint with no cassette entries), verify the pipeline completes with heuristic-only findings and no errors — the ReplayableLLMClient returns empty findings for unmatched seeds.\\n\\n5. After the test, restore the original env vars (`SBI_AI_MODE`, `SBI_CASSETTE_DIR`, `OPENAI_API_KEY`).\\n\\nThis proves the cassette replay infrastructure works end-to-end through the real pipeline without requiring API keys or network access.\",\n  \"requiredChecks\": [\n    \"lint\",\n    \"typecheck\",\n    \"unit\"\n  ]\n}\n\nYou are the first agent to work on this step.\nImplement the changes described above, run checks to verify, and fix any issues before handing off.\nBe thorough — the next agent will review your work and should find it correct.\n\nWhen done, explain what you reviewed, what you changed (if anything), and your assessment.\n\nEnd with:\nVerdict: approve  — if the step is complete and correct, no more changes needed\nVerdict: changes_made  — if you made fixes or improvements\nVerdict: replan_needed  — if the step is structurally impossible to complet